# MuSHR Nano v2 EAI integration bundle
# Keep the general downloaded-asset ignores above, but include this robot's
# self-contained USD, controller adapter, and focused regression tests.
!/usd/
/usd/*
!/usd/robot/
/usd/robot/*
!/usd/robot/mushr_v2/
/usd/robot/mushr_v2/*
